1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,260
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:03,385
Let's sing and learn shapes!

3
00:00:03,935 --> 00:00:05,971
Shapes, shapes, shapes!

4
00:00:07,321 --> 00:00:09,392
This is a circle.

5
00:00:09,792 --> 00:00:11,345
Circle, circle,

6
00:00:11,345 --> 00:00:12,897
I see a circle!

7
00:00:13,447 --> 00:00:15,142
A circle is round,

8
00:00:15,142 --> 00:00:16,352
like a ball.

9
00:00:17,702 --> 00:00:19,654
This is a square.

10
00:00:20,054 --> 00:00:21,486
Square, square,

11
00:00:21,486 --> 00:00:22,917
I see a square!

12
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:25,545
A square has four sides,

13
00:00:25,545 --> 00:00:26,777
all the same.

14
00:00:28,127 --> 00:00:30,460
This is a triangle.

15
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,719
Triangle, triangle,

16
00:00:32,719 --> 00:00:34,408
I see a triangle!

17
00:00:34,958 --> 00:00:37,601
A triangle has three sides.

18
00:00:38,951 --> 00:00:40,880
This is a star.

19
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,569
Star, star,

20
00:00:42,569 --> 00:00:44,042
I see a star!

21
00:00:44,592 --> 00:00:47,092
A star twinkles in the sky.

22
00:00:48,442 --> 00:00:51,446
Circle, square, triangle, star.

23
00:00:51,696 --> 00:00:53,023
Shapes are fun,

24
00:00:53,023 --> 00:00:54,498
wherever you are!

25
00:00:57,148 --> 00:00:59,005
This is a heart.

26
00:00:59,405 --> 00:01:00,676
Heart, heart,

27
00:01:00,676 --> 00:01:02,026
I see a heart!

28
00:01:02,576 --> 00:01:04,695
A heart means love.

29
00:01:06,045 --> 00:01:08,283
This is a rectangle.

30
00:01:08,683 --> 00:01:10,630
Rectangle, rectangle,

31
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:12,333
I see a rectangle!

32
00:01:12,883 --> 00:01:15,525
A rectangle looks like a door.

33
00:01:16,875 --> 00:01:18,923
This is an oval.

34
00:01:19,323 --> 00:01:20,643
Oval, oval,

35
00:01:20,643 --> 00:01:22,246
I see an oval!

36
00:01:22,796 --> 00:01:25,154
An oval looks like an egg.

37
00:01:26,504 --> 00:01:28,599
This is a diamond.

38
00:01:28,999 --> 00:01:30,736
Diamond, diamond,

39
00:01:30,736 --> 00:01:32,386
I see a diamond!

40
00:01:32,936 --> 00:01:35,483
A diamond looks like a kite.

41
00:01:36,833 --> 00:01:38,810
Where is the circle?

42
00:01:41,010 --> 00:01:42,198
There it is!

43
00:01:42,198 --> 00:01:43,308
The circle!

44
00:01:44,658 --> 00:01:46,610
Where is the star?

45
00:01:48,810 --> 00:01:50,065
There it is!

46
00:01:50,065 --> 00:01:51,068
The star!

47
00:01:52,418 --> 00:01:54,252
Where is the heart?

48
00:01:56,452 --> 00:01:57,705
There it is!

49
00:01:57,705 --> 00:01:58,790
The heart!

50
00:02:00,140 --> 00:02:03,897
Circle, square, triangle, star, heart, rectangle,

51
00:02:03,897 --> 00:02:05,342
oval and diamond!

52
00:02:05,892 --> 00:02:08,130
Great job, little learner!

53
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:10,569
Share Mimzi with a friend,

54
00:02:10,569 --> 00:02:13,108
and subscribe for more learning fun!

55
00:02:13,658 --> 00:02:14,657
Next time,

56
00:02:14,657 --> 00:02:16,884
let's learn big and small.

57
00:02:17,134 --> 00:02:18,505
Bye bye!
